{"title":"Laplace transform","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Laplace Transform</b> of a function is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Linear_transformation&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Linear transformation (page does not exist)\">linear transformation</a> from the space of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/e/51e55f21ee41db14d2fbc5e5d3376a52432ae9d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Re \\to \\Re$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12e3412ce1c7f9e9be5b98ec0dc7a513787fbbac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Re$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> is the space of integratable functions) defined as \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c09a9374c66f75810eff10e76a71174c932b8031.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\pounds \\{ f \\} (s) = F(s) = \\int _{0} ^ {\\infty} e^{-st} f(t) dt\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uses\">Uses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Laplace_transform&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Uses\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Laplace Transform is a technique used to solve <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Differential_equation\" title=\"Differential equation\">differential equation</a> when some of the coefficients are not continuous functions. \n</p><p>We first take the Laplace Transform of the equation, then solve the resulting algebra equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d0b94a368cd582715843b4d0876c3f4948d511b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y(s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" />, and then take the inverse Laplace Transform of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d0b94a368cd582715843b4d0876c3f4948d511b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y(s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Here is a convenient table for reference:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Table of Laplace Tranforms\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"”width:75%”\">1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/6/766a4cbe25cde806229cc67dfa3cc138b3efbf59.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{s}, s&gt;0\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccfd63e56b0712af177adb069244d3fb35a25c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e^{at}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"16\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f07c58adc2a5beb5df9aba13f264bf6a6cdd2d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{s-a}, s&gt;a\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"37\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/a/e7a71c89a0fb6890e6ae5f1fb8f37887494117fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^n, \\text{n is a positive integer}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/f/f9fea45e965cc68020cc18b1c8d142219b867ee2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{n!}{s^{n+1}},s&gt;0\\]\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b42c5ab53a333ac9bfd5cc9e4b2245efaf3ee718.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^p, p&gt;-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efef321db369d2a4cb39a89ef0721fb0507e418d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\Gamma (p+1)}{s^{p+1}}, s&gt;0\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"38\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bba5cda2282d64f977671726421775f43b1bc6ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin (at)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cfdf63edb2f560ada85d08d6c5b966c37914a43.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{s^2+a^2},s&gt;0\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"34\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866e408fe56932c1fdd221a79f3404950bf507e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (at)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/0/570d81d447348238398bbc3e033aa1cddd12a695.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{s}{s^2+a^2}, s&gt;0\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"34\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/c/09ca706beda4e5c6f6642e03a379693e3ecd5c5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sinh (at)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/beba120e52d3a38ad1ba3e3e9a207e593831188f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{s^2-a^2}, s&gt;|a|\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"32\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b517c9ad0cbb27fe0fbec3fefe21ddd711e005e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cosh (at)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c166ce1c68d54f8990b12ec6c8d24e2c2dab47b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{s}{s^2-a^2}, s&gt;|a|\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"32\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/2/ab2897ef4e69800c2b3826343c705ce6865c93a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Heaviside} (t-a) = \\begin{cases} 1 &amp;\\text{if } t \\ge a \\\\ 0 &amp;\\text{if } t &lt; a \\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"245\" height=\"55\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/7/eb75325891779d5e27711d5a656c63215d6e9850.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{e^{-as}}{s}, s&gt;0\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"36\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/2/432b9ad543436acc76b822c1fac4bb35e6c5079a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Heaviside} (t-a) \\cdot f(t-a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"200\" height=\"20\" /></td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/299858820468af76959c7e8ade3ba1d3c177294d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[F(s-a)\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Example\">Example</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Laplace_transform&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Example\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve the differential equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/e/4cedbf0f76a7b1b1adae5edb9d290f2bf4ddd521.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y&#39;&#39;+y= H(t-5)\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/226ee33d850ffd4dc7cf8519c03b2f40e716a2b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H(t)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" /> is the Heaviside function, defined as \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe60b118092d96e24e35ab702131b3aae4f4f6f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[H(x)= \\begin{cases} x^2 &amp;\\text{if } x \\ge 0 \\\\ x &amp;\\text{if } x &lt; 0 \\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><i>Solution:</i> \n</p><p>We take the Laplace transe\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Laplace_transform&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Differential_equations\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Differential equations\">Differential equations</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Laplace_transform&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018002717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 164/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 292/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5353/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.622      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.622      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:30582:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018002717 and revision id 239860. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}